# Endings of the simple future that place कल on TOMORROW: "कल सुबह हम
# उनकी मदद करेंगे".  Source: Kamta Prasad Guru, Hindi Vyakaran (1927),
# section "सामान्य भविष्यत् काल": the simple future is the subjunctive form
# plus गा (masculine singular), गे (masculine plural) or गी (feminine), "जैसे,
# जाऊँगा, जायेंगे, जायगी, जाओगी".  The subjunctive vowel is written as a full
# letter after a vowel stem (खाएँगे) and as a sign after a consonant stem
# (करेंगे).  A token matches when it ends in one of these and has a stem
# before it.  The sign form ोगी is left out: it also ends the nouns रोगी,
# योगी and उपयोगी.
ऊँगा
ऊंगा
ूँगा
ूंगा
ऊँगी
ऊंगी
ूँगी
ूंगी
एगा
ेगा
एगी
ेगी
एँगे
एंगे
ेँगे
ेंगे
एँगी
एंगी
ेँगी
ेंगी
ओगे
ोगे
ओगी
